    "References": "[1] Florez-Orrego, D., Ribeiro Domingos, M. E. G., Marechal, F., A systematic framework for the multi-time integration of industrial complexes and urban systems, 7th International Conference on Contemporary Problems of Thermal Engineering - CPOTE 2022, Warsaw, Poland, 20th-23th September, 2022",
    "Grade": "GRAY-BOX",
